Hello,

I just noticed that seminar.sty uses \footheight. seminar.sty centers slides
between the header and the footer. To keep the position
constant even though the actual size of the footers and headers
can change slightly from one slide to another, I use
\headheight and \footheight instead of the actual size of
the header and footer.

